s a left adjoint\n<MATH_0007>\nwhich is exact.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nMoreover, the two functors <MATH_0008> agree on underlying sheaves\nof abelian groups.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c6fcd6ec1cdf96f35625814ee258aaeceae281cb056017b6860e363fbc7e9212", "unit_id": "tag:04CC:statement"}
